WEBVTT

00:11:26.426 --> 00:11:30.898
zavračamo nihilizem obupa.

00:11:30.898 --> 00:11:34.131
Vztrajamo pri veri v prihodnost

00:11:34.131 --> 00:11:38.869
in v drug drugega.

00:11:38.869 --> 00:11:42.370
Recite temu naivnost, če hočete.

00:11:42.370 --> 00:11:45.467
Recite temu nemogoč idealizem,
če že morate.

00:11:45.467 --> 00:11:47.895
A nekaj je gotovo:

00:11:47.895 --> 00:11:51.361
recite temu človeško.

00:11:51.361 --> 00:11:54.396
Ali bi lahko Mohamed tako radikalno 
spremenil svoj svet

00:11:54.396 --> 00:11:57.248
brez takšne vere, ne da bi zavrnil

00:11:57.248 --> 00:12:01.964
aroganco gotovosti omejenega duha?